<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Westinghouse begun as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Westinghouse begun as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said on Tuesday it started coverage of Westinghouse Electric Corp with a buy rating and a 24-month price target of $36 a share.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Alan Kassan said his buy rating was based on strong growth for the company's radio broadcasting network, a potential turnaround at the television network and better margins at television stations, with improvements at the network.</p>
<p>-- The stock gained 9/16 to 24-7/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
